<title>USA: Lamar Advertising Co earnings results.</title>
<headline>Lamar Advertising Co earnings results.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(IN THOUSANDS, EXCEPT SHARE AND PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>				  Three Months Ended Two Months Ended</p>
<p>						Jan 31,	     Dec 31,</p>
<p>						   1996		  1996</p>
<p> Revenues				    27,612		23,262</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)			1,001	     (8,054)</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss) per common</p>
<p>   share					  .03		 (.26)</p>
<p>NOTE - On December 17, 1996, the company's board of directors voted to change Lamar's fiscal year so that it will end on December 31 of each year. The company's last fiscal year ended October 31, 1996. The two-month period from November 1, 1996, to December 31, 1996, is to be treated as a transition period that will not be a part of fiscal year 1996 or calendar year 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
